-OWNED STORES ARE OPEN ACROSS GLOBE.QTRLY SELLING AND ADMINISTRATIVE EXPENSE DECREASED 6 PERCENT TO $3.2 BILLION.TODAY, ROUGHLY 85 PERCENT OF NIKE-OWNED STORES ARE OPEN IN NORTH AMERICA.IN GREATER CHINA, NEARLY 100%OF NIKE-OWNED STORES ARE OPEN.TODAY, ABOUT 90 PERCENT OF NIKE-OWNED STORES ARE OPEN IN EMEA.AS OF MAY 31, 2020 INVENTORIES FOR NIKE, INC. WERE $7.4 BILLION, UP 31 PERCENT.APPROXIMATELY 65 PERCENT OF NIKE-OWNED STORES ARE OPEN IN APLA OR OPERATING UNDER REDUCED HOURS..TOTAL LIQUIDITY AT MAY 31 WAS $12.5 BILLION.QTRLY NORTH AMERICA TOTAL REVENUE WAS $2.23 BILLION VERSUS $4.17 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.QTRLY EMEA TOTAL REVENUE WAS $1.33 BILLION VERSUS $2.46 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.QTRLY GREATER CHINA TOTAL REVENUE WAS $1.65 BILLION VERSUS ABOUT $1.70 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.QTRLY SELLING AND ADMINISTRATIVE EXPENSE DECREASED 6% TO $3.2 BILLION.QTRLY DEMAND CREATION EXPENSE WAS $823 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2020-06-26 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'T-Mobile Says It Files Prospectus Supplement Related To Offering Of 143.4 Mln Shares Of Common Stock', 'text': 'T-MOBILE US INC SAYS IT FILES PROSPECTUS SUPPLEMENT RELATED TO OFFERING OF 143.4 MILLION SHARES OF COMMON STOCK - SEC FILING.T-MOBILE - FILES PROSPECTUS SUPPLEMENT RELATED TO OFFERING OF 143.4 MILLION SHARES AT OFFERING PRICE OF $103.00.'}{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2020-06-26 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'United Announces Upsized Pricing Of Mileageplus Senior Secured Notes Offering', 'text': 'UNITED ANNOUNCES UPSIZED PRICING OF MILEAGEPLUS SENIOR SECURED NOTES OFFERING.UNITED AIRLINES - AGGREGATE OF $3.8 BILLION IN PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 6.50% SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2027 EXPECTED TO BE ISSUED ON JULY 2, 2020.UNITED AIRLINES - NOTES AND TERM LOAN FACILITY, IN A TOTAL AGGREGATE AMOUNT OF $6.8 BILLION, REPLACE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED COMMITTED TERM LOAN FACILITY.UNITED AIRLINES - EXPECTS MILEAGEPLUS SUBSIDIARIES TO ENTER INTO CREDIT AGREEMENT PROVIDING FOR A TERM LOAN FACILITY FOR AGGREGATE OF $3.0 BILLION.'}